      "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThe key observation from <REF_0001> is that universal injectivity \ncan be usefully reformulated in terms of a splitting, using the usual\nconstruction of an injective cogenerator in <MATH_0001>.\n\n",
