    {
      "unit_id": "tag:08WV:statement",
      "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a universally injective morphism in <MATH_0002>. By \nchoosing a splitting\n<MATH_0003> of <MATH_0004>, we may construct a functorial splitting of <MATH_0005> \nfor each <MATH_0006>.\nNamely, by (<REF_0001>) this amounts to splitting <MATH_0007>  functorially in <MATH_0008>,\nand this is achieved by the map <MATH_0009>.\n",
