      "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nFor a ring <MATH_0001> and <MATH_0002> generating the unit\nideal, the morphism <MATH_0003> is\nuniversally injective. Although this is immediate from\nLemma <REF_0001>,\nit is instructive to check it directly: we immediately reduce to the case\nwhere <MATH_0004> is local, in which case some <MATH_0005> must be a unit and so the map\n<MATH_0006> is an isomorphism.\n<STRUCT_0002>",
