      "kind": "locked-English-neighbor",
      "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a ring. A morphism <MATH_0002> in <MATH_0003> is universally\ninjective if and only if <MATH_0004> is a split surjection.\n<STRUCT_0002>",
      "protected_nodes": {
